#NEXUS

[ dieudonné2020a_fig1: Ornithischian time tree. Branches read from the PDF's vector lines (1.0 pt), which drop the Abrictosaurus and one pachycephalosaur line; those parts were read by eye from a crop. The circled numbers 1-7 are caption keys (Ornithischia, Thyreophora, Cerapoda, Marginocephalia, Ceratopsia, Pachycephalosauria, Ornithopoda), not printed names, so no internal labels are encoded; ORNITHOPODA, printed at a line's end, is a tip. One four-way node: Prenocephale, Homalocephale, Stegoceras and Pachycephalosaurus. 33 tips, 1 polytomies (4 children). Sample 4 case (census 2, seed 20261201). Topology read from the PDF's own vector branch lines and checked against the figure; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=33;
    TAXLABELS
        Herrerasaurus_ischigualastensis
        Chilesaurus_diegosuarezi
        Laquintasaura_venezuelae
        Lesothosaurus_diagnosticus
        Scutellosaurus_lawleri
        Emausaurus_ernsti
        Scelidosaurus_harrisonii
        Ankylosauria
        Stegosauria
        Isaberrysaura_mollensis
        Eocursor_parvus
        Agilisaurus_louderbacki
        Hexinlusaurus_multidens
        Liaoceratops_yanzigouensis
        Archaeoceratops_oshimai
        Stenopelix_valdensis
        Yinlong_downsi
        Chaoyangsaurus_youngi
        Psittacosaurus_major
        Psittacosaurus_mongoliensis
        Fruitadens_haagarorum
        Lycorhinus_angustidens
        Heterodontosaurus_tucki
        Abrictosaurus_consors
        Tianyulong_confuciusi
        Echinodon_becklesii
        Wannanosaurus_yansiensis
        Goyocephale_lattimorei
        Prenocephale_prenes
        Homalocephale_calathocercos
        Stegoceras_validum
        Pachycephalosaurus_wyomingensis
        ORNITHOPODA
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE 'dieudonné2020a_fig1' = [&R] (Herrerasaurus_ischigualastensis,(Chilesaurus_diegosuarezi,(Laquintasaura_venezuelae,(Lesothosaurus_diagnosticus,((Scutellosaurus_lawleri,(Emausaurus_ernsti,(Scelidosaurus_harrisonii,(Ankylosauria,(Stegosauria,Isaberrysaura_mollensis))))),(Eocursor_parvus,((Agilisaurus_louderbacki,Hexinlusaurus_multidens),((((Liaoceratops_yanzigouensis,Archaeoceratops_oshimai),(Stenopelix_valdensis,(Yinlong_downsi,(Chaoyangsaurus_youngi,(Psittacosaurus_major,Psittacosaurus_mongoliensis))))),((Fruitadens_haagarorum,(Lycorhinus_angustidens,(Heterodontosaurus_tucki,Abrictosaurus_consors))),(Tianyulong_confuciusi,(Echinodon_becklesii,(Wannanosaurus_yansiensis,(Goyocephale_lattimorei,(Prenocephale_prenes,Homalocephale_calathocercos,Stegoceras_validum,Pachycephalosaurus_wyomingensis))))))),ORNITHOPODA))))))));
